    "body": "> Yeah, I don't really know the answer. It's not clear whether the CSSOM spec and CSS Syntax spec were designed to integrate with each other :(.\r\n\r\nThey weren't, directly at least. CSSOM came first and has been completely hand-wavey, I wrote Syntax in a hopefully usable fashion, but CSSOM was still too handwavey to really *use* a precise algo anyway. OM hasn't had an *active* editor since zcorpan left. :(",
